A_666 - Still on the subject of artificial intelligence, it's worth noting that there may be cases where the answers it gives us are completely false or incorrect, without any doubt on its part, perhaps even calling our sanity into question. Therefore, it's necessary to be careful and pragmatic when using this tool. It remains a tool and isn't infallible, as it relies on the information it was trained on. Furthermore, even for somewhat cutting-edge and innovative tasks, it may not be cooperative, as it prefers to keep us on "safe" tracks rather than letting us go on paths where we take risks.